      "side": 1,
      "message": "Similar question to https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/bmcweb/+/38570/comment/66be6b99_403d9c21/,\nThe parent processor has an unconditional link - \n```\n  \"SubProcessors\": {\n    \"@odata.id\": \"/redfish/v1/Systems/system/Processors/cpu0/SubProcessors\"\n  },\n```\n\nAnd, CollectionGET may be better to give the empty collection if there are no cores.\n\nThen, would it also make sense to give the unconditional head?",
      "parentUuid": "b536d1ac_51bc6ac3",
      "revId": "25d58d38e516e48258b061d56237b3adf8e36a2e",
